msgid ""
"This section contains topics to help you get started with developing "
"MAVProxy and MAVProxy modules. This section assumes basic knowledge of "
"setting up development environments, Python and git."
msgstr ""
"本节包含帮助您开始开发 MAVProxy 及 MAVProxy 模块的相关主题。本节假定您具备搭建开发环境、Python 和 git 的基础知识。"

#: ../../source/docs/development/index.rst:12 48126ec8f45d498d86ef39194119588d
msgid ""
"For developing MAVProxy, a slightly more complex setup is required. The "
"following section will show how this setup is achieved for Linux and "
"Windows."
msgstr "开发 MAVProxy 需要较为复杂的环境配置。以下章节将介绍如何在 Linux 和 Windows 上实现此配置。"
